        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Chain 4. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 1 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 1 ch, 2 sc in last ch (10 st) (10 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (16 st) (16 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 3: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (22 st) (22 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 4: Decrease 6 stitches evenly around (16 st) (16 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 5: Decrease 6 stitches evenly around (10 st). FO leaving 15 cm tail for closure. (10 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
